{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10132210","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10132210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1013221001:1":{"text":"메린, 함께한 시간은 그리 길지 않지만, 난 항상 너와 친구가 되고 싶었어.","source_cn":"梅瑞特，虽然没有太多时间相处，其实我一直想跟你成为朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F04CDE447885D6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013221002:1":{"text":"응? 난 이미 우리가 친구라고 생각했는걸?! 그리고 다음에 만났을 때는 제발 감옥에 갇히지 않았으면 좋겠어.","source_cn":"啊？我还以为我们已经是朋友了。不过，希望下次见面的时候...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88F9CC56A5424AFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013221003:1":{"text":"나도 일부러 그런 건 아니었어... 다음에는 꼭 보석 마법에 정진해서 라이세움 합격통지서를 보여줄게!","source_cn":"我也不是故意的……下次，我一定精进宝石魔法，拿着莱希拉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1090BC0777C0E7F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013221004:1":{"text":"약속한 거다! 전 이제 가볼게요. 다들 다음에 또 만나요.","source_cn":"一言为定！我就不久留了，各位，再见啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2A2DC19FF22A354","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1013221004":{"text":"약속한 거다! 전 이제 가볼게요. 다들 다음에 또 만나요.","source_cn":"一言为定！我就不久留了，各位，再见啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2A2DC19FF22A354","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013221005:1":{"text":"얼른 다시 만날 수 있길 바랄게요. 부디 조심하세요!","source_cn":"你们才是要小心！希望下次很快还能见面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE930286E3C6C18F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1013221007:2":{"text":"잘 가요, 궁수 메린 양!","source_cn":"再见，弓箭手梅瑞特小姐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA82D4E4C062B788B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"안녕, 조심히 가","source_cn":"就此别过，一路小心","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6A235226705A7AD0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"안녕, 조심히 가","female":"안녕, 조심히 가","variant_male_record_index":"62410","variant_female_record_index":"62411","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1013221006:1":{"text":"별말씀을요, 여러분과 함께하면서 저도 많이 배웠어요... 제가 오히려 감사하죠!","source_cn":"哪里的话，与你们同行我学了好几招……我才应该说谢谢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59216F96CDF251D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"고마워, 메린","source_cn":"谢谢你，梅瑞特","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2435E8A1A7CE46B4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"고마워, 메린","female":"고마워, 메린","variant_male_record_index":"62412","variant_female_record_index":"62413","document_title":"","doc